SUMMARY:One Piece: Starter Deck Party (ST-31~ST-36)
DTSTAMP:20260717T061415Z
DTSTART:20260731T180000Z
DESCRIPTION:🏴‍☠️ Join CCS and Omega Gaming for the One Piece: Starter Deck Par
	ty! Whether you’re brand new to the ONE PIECE CARD GAME or looking to try 
	one of the new ST-31 to ST-36 decks\, this event is the perfect way to jum
	p in\, learn the game\, and battle with fellow NAKAMA in a fun and beginne
	r-friendly setting. Players capped at 16. \n  \n🗓️ : July 31\, 2026 \n📍: 97
	00 Bissonnet St\, #1500\, Houston\, TX 77036 \n  \nEvent Overview: \n\nFor
	mat: Standard\nTournament Structure: Sealed\nExpected Number of Rounds: 4\
	nEntry: $20\, (purchase of deck on-site)\nRegistration: On Site or through
	 Bandai app\n\n  \n💰 Prize Pool: \n\n1st Place: Winner Pack\nParticipation
	: Store Tournament Participation Pack\n\n  \n📋 Registration Details: \n\nD
	oors Open: 3:00 PM\nRegistration Opens: 6:00 PM\nRound 1 Begins: 7:00 PM\n
